  | 13:'  Render a 3D "extruded" letter (or text) using _MAPTRIANGLE(3D).
  | 20:'    4) Each rectangle becomes a quad => 2 triangles => drawn with _MAPTRIANGLE(3D).
  | 34:'  - Use hardware textures ONLY as sources for _MAPTRIANGLE / _PUTIMAGE.
  | 35:'  - Do NOT rely on _DEST to a hardware image for "rendering into it".
  | 39:'  - _MAPTRIANGLE(3D) draws to the OpenGL layer over the screen.
  | 41:'      * Clear depth buffer: _DEPTHBUFFER _CLEAR
  | 171:_Title "3D Font (_MAPTRIANGLE 3D) - scanline extrude (QB64PE-safe)"
